{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to LexiRogue\u2014 more than just a typing game, it's a learning adventure that blends strategy, science, and personalization. Dive into a roguelite-style journey with buff combinations for thrilling challenges, or follow the scientifically-backed 21-day memory method for steady improvement. You can even customize AI-API integrations to create a dynamic, tailored review plan. With multi-tier leaderboards and a rich achievement system, your progress and triumphs will be celebrated every step of the way. Join now and make mastering vocabulary an exciting and rewarding journey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First, download the word library</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853330/extras/49a61c60b5fc57e61aa139b9e7ee5cfb.poster.avif?t=1761377574\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853330/extras/49a61c60b5fc57e61aa139b9e7ee5cfb.webm?t=1761377574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853330/extras/49a61c60b5fc57e61aa139b9e7ee5cfb.mp4?t=1761377574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select the downloaded word library to start playing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853330/extras/02ad6aaa65dfd6aeb966732d8f2d36fc.poster.avif?t=1761377574\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853330/extras/02ad6aaa65dfd6aeb966732d8f2d36fc.webm?t=1761377574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853330/extras/02ad6aaa65dfd6aeb966732d8f2d36fc.mp4?t=1761377574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is also a study mode, which can be used to learn words before playing the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853330/extras/a7dc6aa20f7a41d74b88df9bc108212a.poster.avif?t=1761377574\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853330/extras/a7dc6aa20f7a41d74b88df9bc108212a.webm?t=1761377574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853330/extras/a7dc6aa20f7a41d74b88df9bc108212a.mp4?t=1761377574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, based on the 21-day memory model, the system will prompt you to review the words for the day. Once completed, the number of words indicated by the arrow will advance sequentially until the entire word bank is finished. The basic review includes &quot;dictation,&quot; where you write out the words based on prompts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853330/extras/643d813f58b7647a8285f3b2f41c2e0f.avif?t=1761377574\" width=1152 height=648 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853330/extras/55bb91ebec7c366fb6bf34f1f883dea7.avif?t=1761377574\" width=1152 height=648 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If answered correctly, the user proceeds to the next review stage. If incorrect, the word is marked as unlearned and the review restarts from the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, a beta AI review feature is available. Users can generate review questions using most online services compatible with the OpenAI API format.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First, users need to apply for the API service from their chosen provider, obtain a TOKEN, and fill it in the settings interface. The demo uses DeepSeek (recommended), but other products supporting OpenAI API calls\u2014or even self-hosted AI services\u2014are also compatible. This is a flexible, player-customizable option.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853330/extras/cb0b5a2cdfd4982a1b2e49a9cb779e45.avif?t=1761377574\" width=1152 height=648 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then during review sessions, the AI function can be invoked to generate questions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853330/extras/728abb6f5cd8634f6df560955c7a345e.poster.avif?t=1761377574\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853330/extras/728abb6f5cd8634f6df560955c7a345e.webm?t=1761377574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853330/extras/728abb6f5cd8634f6df560955c7a345e.mp4?t=1761377574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note: This is a beta feature. Due to the potential instability of AI services, errors may occasionally arise. Furthermore, as most providers charge for API calls, the use of this optional feature is at the player's own discretion and potential cost.\u200b</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently, it only supports learning English for Chinese speakers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3853330?t=1761377574","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3853330?t=1761377574","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853330/2076522bc89dfc56f31dd783b4402a6e6cb2b218/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761377574","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853330/2076522bc89dfc56f31dd783b4402a6e6cb2b218/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761377574","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to LexiRogue\u2014 more than just a typing game, it's a learning adventure that blends strategy, science, and personalization. Dive into a roguelite-style journey with buff combinations for thrilling challenges, or follow the scientifically-backed 21-day memory method for steady improvement. You can even customize AI-API integrations to create a dynamic, tailored review plan. With multi-tier leaderboards and a rich achievement system, your progress and triumphs will be celebrated every step of the way. Join now and make mastering vocabulary an exciting and rewarding journey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First, download the word library</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853330/extras/49a61c60b5fc57e61aa139b9e7ee5cfb.poster.avif?t=1761377574\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853330/extras/49a61c60b5fc57e61aa139b9e7ee5cfb.webm?t=1761377574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853330/extras/49a61c60b5fc57e61aa139b9e7ee5cfb.mp4?t=1761377574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select the downloaded word library to start playing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853330/extras/02ad6aaa65dfd6aeb966732d8f2d36fc.poster.avif?t=1761377574\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853330/extras/02ad6aaa65dfd6aeb966732d8f2d36fc.webm?t=1761377574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853330/extras/02ad6aaa65dfd6aeb966732d8f2d36fc.mp4?t=1761377574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is also a study mode, which can be used to learn words before playing the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853330/extras/a7dc6aa20f7a41d74b88df9bc108212a.poster.avif?t=1761377574\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853330/extras/a7dc6aa20f7a41d74b88df9bc108212a.webm?t=1761377574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853330/extras/a7dc6aa20f7a41d74b88df9bc108212a.mp4?t=1761377574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, based on the 21-day memory model, the system will prompt you to review the words for the day. Once completed, the number of words indicated by the arrow will advance sequentially until the entire word bank is finished. The basic review includes &quot;dictation,&quot; where you write out the words based on prompts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853330/extras/643d813f58b7647a8285f3b2f41c2e0f.avif?t=1761377574\" width=1152 height=648 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853330/extras/55bb91ebec7c366fb6bf34f1f883dea7.avif?t=1761377574\" width=1152 height=648 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If answered correctly, the user proceeds to the next review stage. If incorrect, the word is marked as unlearned and the review restarts from the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, a beta AI review feature is available. Users can generate review questions using most online services compatible with the OpenAI API format.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First, users need to apply for the API service from their chosen provider, obtain a TOKEN, and fill it in the settings interface. The demo uses DeepSeek (recommended), but other products supporting OpenAI API calls\u2014or even self-hosted AI services\u2014are also compatible. This is a flexible, player-customizable option.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853330/extras/cb0b5a2cdfd4982a1b2e49a9cb779e45.avif?t=1761377574\" width=1152 height=648 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then during review sessions, the AI function can be invoked to generate questions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853330/extras/728abb6f5cd8634f6df560955c7a345e.poster.avif?t=1761377574\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853330/extras/728abb6f5cd8634f6df560955c7a345e.webm?t=1761377574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853330/extras/728abb6f5cd8634f6df560955c7a345e.mp4?t=1761377574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note: This is a beta feature. Due to the potential instability of AI services, errors may occasionally arise. Furthermore, as most providers charge for API calls, the use of this optional feature is at the player's own discretion and potential cost.\u200b</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently, it only supports learning English for Chinese speakers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b</p>","developers":["LaoWangDev"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853330/1c274511ae2ad907e6b1a9fc6d71c2c27d5764f3/header.jpg?t=1761377574","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3853330/782458933/3080e777fd37ee42a72f6e5689d34a1c9a265a55/1760001646/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761377573","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/