amstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853330/375316aa3e3208a098b72da6e3ee00e053cd4dbe/ss_375316aa3e3208a098b72da6e3ee00e053cd4dbe.1920x1080.jpg?t=1761377574","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853330/375316aa3e3208a098b72da6e3ee00e053cd4dbe/ss_375316aa3e3208a098b72da6e3ee00e053cd4dbe.600x338.jpg?t=1761377574"}],"short_description":"LexiRogue: A unique keyboard spelling game! It blends Roguelite levels, the 21-day scientific memory method, and configurable AI-API for dynamic reviews. With leaderboards and an achievement system.Currently designed for native Chinese speakers to learn foreign languages.","steam_appid":3853330,"support_info":{"email":"laowang_dev@126.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"Simplified Chinese","type":"game","website":null}